---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const traps = [
  {
    key: 'windows',
    name: 'Windows',
    items: [
      'SRUM measures which processes ran, not which had focus: a sampler asks for the foreground window instead.',
      'Nothing is in front while the screen is locked and off: lock state comes from Windows\' session API.',
      'A sleeping laptop is a gap, never usage: the trend does not draw it.',
      'A logoff kills the sampler: the next start writes the lost span and a gap.',
      'Times are UTC: every span is split at local hour edges at ingest.',
      'Time with no foreground window is kept as its own kind, not guessed.',
    ],
  },
  {
    key: 'android',
    name: 'Android',
    items: [
      'Apps cover only about 0.76 of screen-on time: the headline comes from screen events.',
      'The session open at sync time is real: it is counted, clipped to now.',
      'A session longer than the sync overlap: the next read reaches back to its start.',
      'Foreground-service time is not screen time: only foreground use counts.',
      'Below Android 9 there are no screen events: those phones show time in apps.',
    ],
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 id="how-title">From the focused window to chart, on your PC.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Recorded as it happens, with every trap below handled. Left alone, each one would skew the totals.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="flow" aria-label="The data path">
      <li class="glow node" data-device="windows">
        <span class="node-title"><Icon name="laptop" /> Sample</span>
        <span class="muted">An unelevated sampler notes the focused window every 2 seconds, and whether the session is locked.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="glow node">
        <span class="node-title"><Icon name="fileText" /> Log</span>
        <span class="muted">Each span goes to a daily file, so a crash or a logoff loses nothing already recorded.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="glow node">
        <span class="node-title"><Icon name="database" /> SQLite</span>
        <span class="muted">Hourly, or on <b>Sync now</b>: new spans only, on a second drive, with a backup beside it.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="glow node app">
        <span class="node-title"><Icon name="monitor" /> The dashboard</span>
        <span class="muted">Next.js on port 7844, password-gated. Phones post here too.</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="traps">
      {
        traps.map((t) => (
          <article class="card trap" data-device={t.key}>
            <h3>{t.name}: the {t.items.length} traps it handles</h3>
            <ul>{t.items.map((item) => <li><Icon name="check" />{item}</li>)}</ul>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .flow {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .node {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .node-title {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .node-title :global(svg) {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .app {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* The arrow to the next step: down on phones, right on wide screens. */
  .node:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: -12px;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--text-faint);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--text-faint);
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(45deg);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .flow {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .node:not(:last-child)::after {
      left: auto;
      right: -20px;
      top: 50%;
      bottom: auto;
      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-45deg);
    }
  }

  .traps {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--gap-grid);
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .traps {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .trap {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .trap h3 {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .trap ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .trap li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .trap li :global(svg) {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 3px;
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }
</style>
